Quiet radar.draw still paid projection + isHostileToPlayer across every contact
every 10 Hz tick after #156 asteroid still-layer. Quantized-player + contact-pose
signature reuses retained marks until the pilot moves ≥1 radar px, a contact
moves ≥1 wu, range/target changes, or a 0.5 s rescan. Glyph paint stays live so
pickup pulses keep `now`. Soft-GPU fps not claimed. Picture contract ON.
